.TH JULES-LISTENER 1 "March 2026" "jules-vanager 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
jules-listener \- Background watcher and notifier daemon for Google Jules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jules-listener
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B jules-listener
polls active Google Jules sessions for required user input, pending pull requests, and session completions, dispatching desktop notifications.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-once
Run a single polling cycle and exit immediately.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show summary of options and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jules-manager (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek>.
